### Список документов, типы и локали
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentLists { documents { id type_id translit created_at updated_at } documentTypes documentLocales }"
}

### Список документов
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query Documents { documents { id type_id translit created_at updated_at } }"
}

### Типы документов
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentTypes { documentTypes }"
}

### Локали документов
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": "query DocumentLocales { documentLocales }"
}
